---
import background from "../assets/background.svg";
---

<div class="page-shell">
  <img class="background" src={background.src} alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
  <main class="content">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">PROFILE / PUBLICATIONS</p>
      <h1>森田太郎</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        博士後期課程はNb3Sn材料を研究していました。
        現在はWebエンジニアとして活動しています。
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="papers-heading">
      <h2 id="papers-heading">Publications</h2>
      <ol class="publication-list">
        <li>
          <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cryogenics.2022.103420"
            >Taro Morita, Tsuyoshi Yagai, and Nobuya Banno, "Impact of Ti-doping
            position on Nb3Sn layer formation in internal Sn-processed Nb3Sn
            superconducting wires". In Cryogenics 122 (2022), p. 103420</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/TASC.2022.3163119"
            >Taro Morita et al. "Influence of Ti-Hf Doping on the Nb3Sn Layer
            Formation in Bronze-Processed Nb3Sn Wire Structure". In: IEEE
            Transactions on Applied Superconductivity 32.6 (2022), pp. 1-5. doi:
            10.1109/TASC.2022.3163119.</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9360513"
            >Taro Morita, Tsuyoshi Yagai, and Nobuya Banno. "Diffusion Reaction
            Behavior in Internal Tin Nb3Sn Wire Using Nb/Cu-Ti/Sn-Zn Diffusion
            Configuration". In: IEEE Transactions on Applied Superconductivity
            31.5 (2021), pp. 1-5. doi: 10.1109/TASC.2021.3061035.</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/8982069"
            >Taro Morita, Tsuyoshi Yagai, and Nobuya Banno. "Fabrication of New
            Internal Tin Nb3Sn Wire Using Sn-Zn Alloy as Sn Core". In: IEEE
            Transactions on Applied Superconductivity 30.4 (2020), pp. 1-5. doi:
            10.1109/TASC.2020.2971451.</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0925838820318296"
            >Taro Morita, Tsuyoshi Yagai, and Nobuya Banno. “Microstructural
            study on Sn-Zn/Cu-Ti diffusion reaction for internal tin Nb3Sn
            conductor development”. In: Journal of Alloys and Compounds 848
            (2020), p. 155465. issn: 0925-8388. doi:
            https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2020.155465.</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/8693988"
            >Taro Morita et al. "Microstructure and Superconducting Properties
            of Brass Matrix Internal Tin Nb3Sn Wire With Ti Doping to Nb Core".
            In: IEEE Transactions on Applied Superconductivity 29.5 (2019), pp.
            1-5. doi: 10.1109/TASC.2019.2910020.</a
          >
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="section links-section" aria-labelledby="links-heading">
      <h2 id="links-heading">Links</h2>
      <ul class="links-list">
        <li>
          <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/blog/`}>ブログ記事一覧 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.awesometaro.com"
            >外部ブログ <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://x.com/jirorian_tele"
            >X <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>

<style>
  .background {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: -1;
    object-fit: cover;
    opacity: 0.14;
    filter: blur(80px) saturate(0.65);
  }

  .page-shell {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: clamp(32px, 7vw, 88px) 24px;
    color: #202a27;
    font-family: "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", "Yu Gothic", Meiryo, sans-serif;
  }

  .content {
    width: min(100%, 760px);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-header {
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(32, 42, 39, 0.2);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 12px 0 16px;
    font-family: "Yu Mincho", "Hiragino Mincho ProN", serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 7vw, 58px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: #55746b;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 36em;
    margin: 0;
    color: #53615c;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 32px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(32, 42, 39, 0.16);
  }

  h2 {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .section-note {
    color: #75827d;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .profile-list,
  .publication-list,
  .links-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .profile-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 24px;
    list-style: none;
    color: #53615c;
  }

  .publication-list {
    padding-left: 1.5em;
    color: #55746b;
  }

  .publication-list li {
    padding: 0 0 18px 8px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .publication-list li:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .publication-list a {
    color: #34443e;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(85, 116, 107, 0.38);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }

  .publication-list a:hover,
  .links-list a:hover {
    color: #16836b;
  }

  .links-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px 28px;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .links-list a {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
    color: #34443e;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }

  .links-list span {
    color: #75827d;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .page-shell {
      padding: 36px 20px;
    }

    .page-header {
      padding-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 26px 0;
    }

    .profile-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
    }
  }
</style>
